WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:11.500
Use a sturdy chair against a wall. Sit in the middle of the seat, feet flat, arms crossed over your chest.

2
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:23.500
On go, stand fully and sit fully as many times as you can in 30 seconds. Stop if you feel pain or dizziness.

3
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:29.500
Log the number of full stands in Progress. We repeat this test every four weeks.
